The THS317 is used to measure the ambient temperature & humidity with built-in sensor, or external temperature with remote probe. The 2.5m long probe allows you to measure liquid or enclosed space temperatures, reaching areas that normal sensors cannot.

## Key Features

- ZigBee 3.0
- Environmental temperature & humidity measuring
- Remote probe (external temperature)
- 2.5m probe cable for liquid and enclosed spaces
- Low power consumption
